      "doc_id": "c4ceca78cee7",
      "text": "It appears to be a genuine Samsung phone, however .... It appears to be a genuine Samsung phone, however there is a problem: the battery drains very quickly. Even though I tried to turn off a lot of stuff, it's still hard to make it to late a full day. A search revealed this model uses a Samsung CPU instead of Qualcomm, which could be the reason. Be mindful if you are a heavier user.",
